  abilityDesc: 38 combo powerful Fire attack on all foes, hugely boosts Atk for 3
    turns, hugely boosts Atk relative to Def for 3 turns, enormously boosts critical
    hit rate for 3 turns, boosts critical damage for 3 turns, enormously boosts Spark
    damage for 3 turns & adds Fire element to attack for 3 turns
